  "configuration_id": "config_039",
  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder, resnet50 image encoder, multiprofile settings, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion (config_033) achieve the highest validation accuracy (0.713). This experiment tests replacing resnet50 with imagenet_vit_l image encoder in the same setup to isolate the effect of image encoder choice. This is critical for determining whether the high performance in config_033 is due to the image encoder or other components, and whether alternative encoders could further improve performance. It balances exploitation of the promising multimodal framework with exploration of key design choices."
}

